        "id": 1056478
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-31T03:39:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is more typical to do this as:\npublic static final class RcsColumns implements BaseColumns\n\nThe same comment applies to the sub-classes; its more typical to see these provider column definitions as classes rather than interfaces (2x as many providers define them as concrete classes than interfaces).",
      "revId": "4795454c2a83977fdba96ff7526e10bb481df461",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
