      "writtenOn": "2019-01-30T02:01:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So if IIUC, this and other such classes are used to create new events as well as return events to the app when queried, correct? What if buildAndSave() gets called multiple times, or on events returned by the implementation? How do we make sure that does not add events to the db?",
      "revId": "4795454c2a83977fdba96ff7526e10bb481df461",
