        "id": 1318036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-30T19:29:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a static inner class so it is not possible to use buildAndSave on an already created event. However it is possible to have a builder instantiated and call this function multiple times. I don\u0027t think that would be an issue as the code below seems useful\n\nBuilder builder \u003d RcsGroupThreadParticipantLeftEvent.builder(someThread, someOwner);\nbuilder.setLeavingParticipant(someParticipant).buildAndSave();\nbuilder.setLeavingParticipant(someOtherParticipant).buildAndSave();\n\nThat being said, we should check in provider side to not create identical events.",
      "parentUuid": "67017974_af0ef3e7",
      "revId": "4795454c2a83977fdba96ff7526e10bb481df461",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
