      "writtenOn": "2019-01-30T02:01:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be set just once when the message is created. Why is there a setter for this?\n\nIn general here and in other classes I don\u0027t think we should have setters for parameters that should be added through CreationParameters and should not be modified after creation.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 41,
        "startChar": 16,
