      "message": "This is REALLY awkward.  You\u0027re revealing details about the underlying RCS message store as part of the querying, and you\u0027re also designing what appears to be a new version of regex.\n\nWhy would we ever want to perform queries like this?  Is it not enough to just query for specific addresses?",
