      "writtenOn": "2019-01-30T19:29:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is to allow draft messages - i.e. the user opened a conversation, typed a few things, then closed the app, then opened it again to continue typing, changed the SIM card to send on etc. all before sending a message. Status especially changes multiple times before the message is successfully sent.\n\nThat being said, received messages could have their own big creator function.",
